  • Your own user and a 5 MB home folder (~), and nothing outside it.
  • No internet, 15 minutes max. Everything disappears when you close it.
  • Try:  ls   cat README.txt   nvim hello.py   python3 hello.py   node hello.js
  • Editors: nvim (i = insert, Esc, :wq = save & quit), nano.  Type `exit` to leave.

